{"id":"1feaf29faedeb413","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_NatRelation.md","title":"NatRelation","display":"NatRelation","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"NatRelation","parameters":["c","H"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"NatRelation"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>c</span><span>H</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：对象理论模型与证明。有序参数：<code>c</code>、<code>H</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ NatRelation c H)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(forall vs\n  (iff\n    (in vs H)\n    (exists w\n      (exists two\n        (exists z\n          (exists one\n            (exists x\n              (exists y\n                (and\n                  (@ Omega w)\n                  (and\n                    (@ Num2 two)\n                    (and\n                      (@ Num0 z)\n                      (and\n                        (@ Num1 one)\n                        (and\n                          (@ SeqTo vs two w)\n                          (and\n                            (@ App vs z x)\n                            (and\n                            (@ App vs one y)\n                            (or\n                            (and (@ Num0 c) (in x y))\n                            (and\n                            (@ Nat c)\n                            (and\n                            (or (= c two) (in two c))\n                            (exists k (exists p (and (@ Mul c k p) (or (@ Add x p y) (@ Add y p x)))))))))))))))))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fe9bf6b2a1b03aa\" href=\"?note=0fe9bf6b2a1b03aa\" title=\"ZFC_Add\">Add</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8bd25e131370b9c4\" href=\"?note=8bd25e131370b9c4\" title=\"ZFC_App\">App</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"46192dc3bc57d713\" href=\"?note=46192dc3bc57d713\" title=\"ZFC_Mul\">Mul</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e2136a636857d477\" href=\"?note=e2136a636857d477\" title=\"ZFC_Nat\">Nat</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e8cec2782b4668b5\" href=\"?note=e8cec2782b4668b5\" title=\"ZFC_Num0\">Num0</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6abf464803506304\" href=\"?note=6abf464803506304\" title=\"ZFC_Num1\">Num1</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36fc33b3a64f5aa9\" href=\"?note=36fc33b3a64f5aa9\" title=\"ZFC_Num2\">Num2</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" href=\"?note=3bcf6cd1d43a3007\" title=\"ZFC_Omega\">Omega</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"572634b8affcd095\" href=\"?note=572634b8affcd095\" title=\"ZFC_SeqTo\">SeqTo</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ NatRelation c H)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_Add","status":"resolved","id":"0fe9bf6b2a1b03aa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerp